Here is your sign-in link

Someone asked to sign in to [PRODUCT_NAME] as [EMAIL_ADDRESS]. If
that was you, open the link below to finish. There is no password
to type, and [COMPANY_NAME] will never ask you for one.

Sign in to [PRODUCT_NAME]:

[CTA_URL]

This link expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent, and it works once. After it signs you in, or after that
time, it stops working and you will need a new one.

The link signs in the device that opens it, so do not forward this
email to anyone.

Important: If you did not ask to sign in, ignore this email. The
link cannot be used by anyone who does not have this mailbox, and
nothing changes on your account until it is opened.

Questions about this sign-in? Reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
